Wajah Tum Ho Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Hate Story 3 sung by Armaan Malik.

Strumming Pattern : D UUD UUD

[Fm] [D#] [C#] [x 3]

[Fm]Kaise [Ab]kahun ishq [C#]mein tere

[A#m]Kitna hoon [Fm]betaab [Ab]main [C#]

[Cm]Aankhon se [D#]aankhe [C#]mila ke

