Mere [Fm]saaye hain [A#m]saath mein

Yaa [Cm]ra jis jag [C#]ah tum [C]ho

Main jo [C#]jee ra [D#]ha [C#]hoon

[Fm]Wajah [D#] t [C#]um h [A#m]o

[Cm] [Fm]Wajah [D#] t [C#]um h [A#m]o

[Fm] [C#] [A#m] [D#]

